            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 2 — Bandeau Trustpilot.\n  Placer ENTRE le bloc Kaching Bundles et le bouton \"Añadir al carrito\".\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign ely_tp_label     = '\"EXCELENTE\"' -%}\n{%- assign ely_tp_score     = 'valorado 4,8/5 en' -%}\n{%- assign ely_tp_show_text = false -%}   {%- comment -%} true = affiche \"valorado 4,8/5 en\" {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign ely_tp_stars     = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/4.5-stars-trustpilot_2157d8d9-101e-46a2-a3fe-ac80f2fecf10_430x.png?v=1786462455' -%}\n{%- assign ely_tp_logo      = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/Trustpilot_Logo__2022_.svg_2_430x.png?v=1786462455' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-tp{\n    background:#e9f8fe;\n    border:1px dashed #006400;\n    border-radius:10px;\n    padding:6px 8px;\n    margin:12px 0;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    gap:4px;\n    font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n  }\n  .ely-tp img{margin:0 8px;height:auto;display:block;}\n  .ely-tp__stars{max-width:82px;width:82px;}\n  .ely-tp__logo{max-width:88px;width:88px;}\n  .ely-tp__label{color:#000;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4px;margin:0 4px;}\n  .ely-tp__score{color:#000;font-size:10px;margin:0 4px;}\n  @media(max-width:380px){\n    .ely-tp img{margin:0 5px;}\n    .ely-tp__stars{max-width:70px;width:70px;}\n    .ely-tp__logo{max-width:76px;width:76px;}\n    .ely-tp__label{font-size:11px;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-tp\">\n  <span class=\"ely-tp__label\">{{ ely_tp_label }}</span>\n\n  <img class=\"ely-tp__stars\"\n       src=\"{{ ely_tp_stars }}\"\n       alt=\"Valoración 4,8 sobre 5\"\n       loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n  {%- if ely_tp_show_text -%}\n    <span class=\"ely-tp__score\">{{ ely_tp_score }}</span>\n  {%- endif -%}\n\n  <img class=\"ely-tp__logo\"\n       src=\"{{ ely_tp_logo }}\"\n       alt=\"Trustpilot\"\n       loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n</div>"
