        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 5 — \"Resultados visibles desde el primer uso\" (média + carte 4 bénéfices).\n  Placement : nouvelle section \"Liquid personalizado\", sous le bloc 4B.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely5' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ───────────── RÉGLAGES ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign ely_media_gif = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/4_17_4_430x.gif?v=1786474827' -%}\n{%- assign ely_media_mp4 = '' -%}   {%- comment -%} ← colle une URL .mp4 ici pour remplacer le GIF (2,5 Mo → ~200 Ko) {%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign ely_r_title    = 'Resultados visibles desde el <em>primer uso</em>' -%}\n{%- assign ely_r_subtitle = 'Un sujetador diseñado para realzar, sujetar y suavizar la silueta sin aros ni molestias.' -%}\n\n{%- assign ico1 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ed1ec600-da9f-4cf6-900c-af5f230be7d1_430x.jpg?v=1786474823' -%}\n{%- assign ico2 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/0ebdedcf-008e-44f9-852a-d3b05da61f06_430x.jpg?v=1786474823' -%}\n{%- assign ico3 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/d7467aae-687a-4cf1-b81f-a855899606c3_430x.jpg?v=1786474824' -%}\n{%- assign ico4 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/6dd30514-6bb8-42b9-b6d2-61b79ed80271_430x.jpg?v=1786474824' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-res{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n    display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 16px;\n    align-items:center;\n    --ely-warm:#B5615A;}\n  .ely-res *,.ely-res *::before,.ely-res *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  .ely-res__media{flex:0 0 42%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#EFE9E1;}\n  .ely-res__media img,\n  .ely-res__media video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;}\n\n  .ely-res__card{flex:1 1 0;background:#FAF3E9;border:1px solid #E7DDCD;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;}\n  .ely-res__title{font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.25;}\n  .ely-res__title em{color:var(--ely-warm);font-style:italic;}\n  .ely-res__sub{font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 16px;}\n\n  .ely-res__item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px;}\n  .ely-res__item:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}\n  .ely-res__ico{width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}\n  .ely-res__item h3{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:0 0 3px;}\n  .ely-res__item p{font-size:12.5px;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;}\n\n  @media(max-width:768px){\n    .ely-res{flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}\n    .ely-res__media,.ely-res__card{width:100%;flex:none;}\n    .ely-res__card{padding:24px 20px;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-res\" id=\"ely-res-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"ely-res__media\">\n    {%- if ely_media_mp4 != blank -%}\n      <video src=\"{{ ely_media_mp4 }}\" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\"\n             aria-label=\"Sujetador invisible Elorya en uso\"></video>\n    {%- else -%}\n      <img src=\"{{ ely_media_gif }}\" alt=\"Sujetador invisible Elorya en uso\"\n           loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\">\n    {%- endif -%}\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-res__card\">\n    <h2 class=\"ely-res__title\">{{ ely_r_title }}</h2>\n    <p class=\"ely-res__sub\">{{ ely_r_subtitle }}</p>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-res__item\">\n      <img class=\"ely-res__ico\" src=\"{{ ico1 }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Realza el pecho</h3>\n        <p>Efecto lifting inmediato sin esfuerzo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-res__item\">\n      <img class=\"ely-res__ico\" src=\"{{ ico2 }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Sin costuras</h3>\n        <p>Invisible bajo cualquier prenda.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-res__item\">\n      <img class=\"ely-res__ico\" src=\"{{ ico3 }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Comodidad total</h3>\n        <p>No aprieta, no marca, no molesta.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-res__item\">\n      <img class=\"ely-res__ico\" src=\"{{ ico4 }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Se pone en segundos</h3>\n        <p>Sin ganchos ni complicaciones, solo ajusta y listo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
