        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 6 — \"Más soporte, mejor forma\" (carte 2 bénéfices + vidéo son au clic).\n  Placement : nouvelle section \"Liquid personalizado\", sous le bloc 5.\n  Mise en page miroir du bloc 5 : texte à gauche, vidéo à droite (desktop) — vidéo en 1er sur mobile.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely6' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ───────────── RÉGLAGES ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_src   = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/9f3e1ff3bf244f96a2e77e029d9ba74b.mp4' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_title = 'Más soporte, mejor forma' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_sub   = 'Diseñado para elevar, moldear y ofrecer una sujeción superior con total comodidad cada día.' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_h1    = 'Se mantiene en su sitio' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_p1    = 'Sin bajarse, sin ajustes constantes, pase lo que pase.' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_h2    = 'Sujeción real, sin marcas' -%}\n{%- assign ely_v_p2    = 'Banda elástica que sujeta sin dejar huella en la piel.' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-vs{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n    display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 16px;\n    align-items:center;}\n  .ely-vs *,.ely-vs *::before,.ely-vs *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  .ely-vs__card{flex:1 1 0;padding:8px 0;}\n  .ely-vs__title{font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.25;}\n  .ely-vs__sub{font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 16px;}\n  .ely-vs__item{margin-bottom:12px;}\n  .ely-vs__item:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}\n  .ely-vs__item h3{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:0 0 3px;}\n  .ely-vs__item p{font-size:12.5px;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;}\n\n  .ely-vs__media{flex:0 0 42%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;\n    cursor:pointer;background:#111;}\n  .ely-vs__video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 20%;display:block;\n    pointer-events:none;}\n  .ely-vs__sound{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:12px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:999px;\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    padding:0;cursor:pointer;z-index:2;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}\n  .ely-vs__sound svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:1.9;\n    stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;display:block;}\n\n  @media(max-width:768px){\n    .ely-vs{flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}\n    .ely-vs__media{width:100%;flex:none;order:1;}\n    .ely-vs__card{width:100%;flex:none;order:2;}\n    .ely-vs__title{text-align:center;}\n    .ely-vs__sub{text-align:center;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-vs\" id=\"ely-vs-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"ely-vs__card\">\n    <h2 class=\"ely-vs__title\">{{ ely_v_title }}</h2>\n    <p class=\"ely-vs__sub\">{{ ely_v_sub }}</p>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-vs__item\">\n      <h3>{{ ely_v_h1 }}</h3>\n      <p>{{ ely_v_p1 }}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-vs__item\">\n      <h3>{{ ely_v_h2 }}</h3>\n      <p>{{ ely_v_p2 }}</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-vs__media\" data-ely-vs-media data-ely-vs-src=\"{{ ely_v_src }}\">\n    <video class=\"ely-vs__video\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"\n           aria-label=\"Sujetador invisible Elorya en uso\"></video>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-vs__sound\" data-ely-vs-sound\n            aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Activar sonido\">\n      <svg class=\"ely-ic-mute\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M11 5 6 9H3v6h3l5 4V5Z\"/><path d=\"m17 9 4 6M21 9l-4 6\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <svg class=\"ely-ic-unmute\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <path d=\"M11 5 6 9H3v6h3l5 4V5Z\"/><path d=\"M16 8.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 0 7\"/><path d=\"M18.5 6a8 8 0 0 1 0 12\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('ely-vs-{{ uid }}');\n  if(!root || root.dataset.elyInit) return;\n  root.dataset.elyInit = '1';\n\n  var media  = root.querySelector('[data-ely-vs-media]');\n  var video  = root.querySelector('.ely-vs__video');\n  var btn    = root.querySelector('[data-ely-vs-sound]');\n  var icMute = root.querySelector('.ely-ic-mute');\n  var icOn   = root.querySelector('.ely-ic-unmute');\n  if(!media || !video) return;\n\n  var loaded = false;\n  function load(){\n    if(loaded) return;\n    loaded = true;\n    var s = document.createElement('source');\n    s.src = media.getAttribute('data-ely-vs-src');\n    s.type = 'video/mp4';\n    video.appendChild(s);\n    video.load();\n    var p = video.play();\n    if(p && p.catch) p.catch(function(){});\n  }\n\n  function paint(){\n    var m = video.muted;\n    icMute.style.display = m ? '' : 'none';\n    icOn.style.display   = m ? 'none' : '';\n    btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', m ? 'true' : 'false');\n    btn.setAttribute('aria-label', m ? 'Activar sonido' : 'Silenciar');\n  }\n\n  function toggle(){ video.muted = !video.muted; paint(); }\n\n  media.addEventListener('click', toggle);\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); toggle(); });\n\n  // Charge + lance quand la vidéo entre dans le viewport ; coupe le son quand elle en sort.\n  if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n    var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n      entries.forEach(function(en){\n        if(en.isIntersecting){\n          load();\n          var p = video.play(); if(p && p.catch) p.catch(function(){});\n        } else {\n          video.muted = true;\n          video.pause();\n          paint();\n        }\n      });\n    }, { threshold: .3 });\n    obs.observe(media);\n  } else {\n    load();\n  }\n\n  paint();\n})();\n</script>",
