        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 8 — \"Miles de mujeres confían en nosotros\" (collage + texte).\n  Placement : nouvelle section \"Liquid personalizado\", sous le bloc 7.\n  Le badge ★★★★★ et le cadre sont intégrés à l'image : aucun overlay ici.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely8' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ───────────── RÉGLAGES ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign img_base = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_11_aout_2026_20_14_10.png?v=1786475664' -%}\n{%- assign ely_tr_title = 'Miles de mujeres confían en nosotros' -%}\n{%- assign ely_tr_sub   = 'Elegido cada día por mujeres que buscan comodidad, sujeción y una sensación increíble desde el primer uso.' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-tr{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n    display:flex;gap:40px;max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px;align-items:center;}\n  .ely-tr *,.ely-tr *::before,.ely-tr *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  .ely-tr__text{flex:1 1 38%;}\n  .ely-tr__title{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,30px);font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.2;}\n  .ely-tr__sub{font-size:15px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0;}\n\n  .ely-tr__fig{flex:1 1 62%;line-height:0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;}\n  .ely-tr__fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;}\n\n  @media(max-width:768px){\n    .ely-tr{flex-direction:column;gap:20px;}\n    .ely-tr__fig{order:1;width:100%;}\n    .ely-tr__text{order:2;width:100%;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-tr\" id=\"ely-tr-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"ely-tr__text\">\n    <h2 class=\"ely-tr__title\">{{ ely_tr_title }}</h2>\n    <p class=\"ely-tr__sub\">{{ ely_tr_sub }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-tr__fig\">\n    <img\n      src=\"{{ img_base }}&width=800&format=jpg\"\n      srcset=\"{{ img_base }}&width=430&format=jpg 430w,\n              {{ img_base }}&width=800&format=jpg 800w,\n              {{ img_base }}&width=1200&format=jpg 1200w\"\n      sizes=\"(min-width: 1100px) 660px, (min-width: 769px) 62vw, 100vw\"\n      width=\"800\" height=\"800\"\n      alt=\"Clientas de Elorya con su pedido\"\n      loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
