    "custom_liquid_AWxyU4": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 10 — FAQ (6 questions).\n  Placement : nouvelle section \"Liquid personalizado\", sous le bloc 9.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely10' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-faq2{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n    background:#F7F3EE;max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;padding:24px 0;border-radius:14px;}\n  .ely-faq2 *,.ely-faq2 *::before,.ely-faq2 *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  .ely-faq2__item{margin:0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12);}\n  .ely-faq2__item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}\n\n  .ely-faq2__q{width:100%;background:none;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:16px 12px;\n    font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;text-align:left;}\n  .ely-faq2__item.is-open .ely-faq2__q{border-color:rgba(0,0,0,.25);}\n\n  .ely-faq2__chev{flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .25s ease;color:#1A1A1A;}\n  .ely-faq2__item.is-open .ely-faq2__chev{transform:rotate(180deg);}\n\n  .ely-faq2__a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease;}\n  .ely-faq2__inner{padding:0 12px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(0,0,0,.78);}\n  .ely-faq2__inner p{margin:0;}\n\n  @media(max-width:600px){\n    .ely-faq2{padding:16px 0;margin:32px 16px;}\n    .ely-faq2__item{margin:0 16px;}\n    .ely-faq2__q{font-size:13.5px;padding:14px 8px;}\n    .ely-faq2__inner{font-size:13px;padding:0 8px 14px;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-faq2\" id=\"ely-faq2-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f1-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Realmente sujeta bien el pecho?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f1-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>Sí. Su banda ancha con doble refuerzo reparte el peso en todo el contorno en lugar de tirar de una tira de silicona. Eleva el pecho y mejora la forma natural, sin aros y sin apretar.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f2-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Es cómodo para llevar todo el día?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f2-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>Sí. El tejido es suave y flexible, se adapta al cuerpo y no marca. De la mañana a la noche, sin tener que recolocártelo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f3-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Se marca debajo de la ropa?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f3-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>No. Al no llevar costuras ni aros, no hay nada que se dibuje bajo la tela — ni con camiseta blanca ni con prendas ajustadas.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f4-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Ayuda con el pecho caído?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f4-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>Sí. Las copas push-up y el soporte reforzado levantan visualmente el pecho y crean una silueta más favorecedora desde el primer uso.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f5-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Sirve para pechos grandes?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f5-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>Sí, hasta talla XL (contorno 100, copa E). Su diseño envolvente y la banda reforzada dan más estabilidad justo donde más se necesita. Si estás entre dos tallas, coge la mayor.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq2__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq2__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-f6-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Cómo sé qué talla elegir?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq2__chev\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq2__a\" id=\"ely-f6-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq2__inner\">\n        <p>Usa la guía de tallas de la página del producto: eliges tu contorno y tu copa y te dice tu talla al instante. Si dudas entre dos, coge la mayor — y llevas un extensor gratis en cada pedido.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('ely-faq2-{{ uid }}');\n  if(!root || root.dataset.elyInit) return;\n  root.dataset.elyInit = '1';\n\n  var items = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.ely-faq2__item'));\n\n  items.forEach(function(item){\n    var btn = item.querySelector('.ely-faq2__q');\n    var ans = item.querySelector('.ely-faq2__a');\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var open = item.classList.toggle('is-open');\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n      ans.style.maxHeight = open ? ans.scrollHeight + 'px' : null;\n    });\n  });\n\n  var t;\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){\n    clearTimeout(t);\n    t = setTimeout(function(){\n      items.forEach(function(item){\n        if(item.classList.contains('is-open')){\n          var ans = item.querySelector('.ely-faq2__a');\n          ans.style.maxHeight = ans.scrollHeight + 'px';\n        }\n      });\n    }, 150);\n  }, {passive:true});\n})();\n</script>",
        "background": "",
        "background_gradient": "",
        "text_color": ""
      }
    },
